<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>WeiFeng Chen | Research Profile</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f7f5fb;
            --card: #f0ecf7;
            --text: #3d3d3f;
            --text-light: #6d6d73;
            --accent: #8e7cc3;
            --accent-dark: #7b69b3;
            --shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(120, 100, 160, 0.08);
            --shadow-hover: 0 8px 24px rgba(120, 100, 160, 0.15);
            --radius: 14px;
            --transition: all 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.7;
            padding: 3rem 1.2rem;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* 个人信息 */
        .profile {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s;
        }

        .name {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .affiliation {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.6rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
        }

        .link {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: var(--transition);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .link:hover {
            background: rgba(142, 124, 195, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* 座右铭 */
        .motto {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.9;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
            border-right: 3px solid var(--accent);
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .motto:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-dark);
            background: rgba(142, 124, 195, 0.05);
            transform: scale(1.01);
        }

        /* 横向论文卡片 */
        .papers {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .paper-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: var(--transition);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .paper-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.01);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
        }

        /* 左图 */
        .paper-figure {
            flex: 0 0 250px;
            background: #f9f7ff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.4rem;
        }

        .paper-figure img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 190px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .paper-card:hover .paper-figure img {
            transform: scale(1.04);
        }

        /* 右文 */
        .paper-content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 1.8rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .paper-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.45;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .paper-authors {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .paper-abstract {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.7;
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 4;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .paper-link {
            margin-top: 0.3rem;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            width: fit-content;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .paper-link:hover {
            background: var(--accent-dark);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* 动画 */
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* 移动端 */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .paper-card {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .paper-figure {
                flex: none;
                padding: 1.4rem;
            }
            .name {
                font-size: 1.9rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="profile">
        <div class="name">WeiFeng Chen</div>
        <div class="affiliation">Department of Bioengineering and Applied Biology<br>Sichuan Agricultural University</div>
        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0003-3501-8569" target="_blank" class="link">
                <i class="fab fa-orcid"></i> ORCID
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:202306783@stu.sicau.edu.cn" class="link">
                <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Email
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- 座右铭 -->
        <div class="motto">
            I drain the Western River for wine,<br>
            With the Big Dipper I pour it, slow and fine;<br>
            All things in the universe now feast as guests of mine.
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 论文 -->
    <div class="papers">
        <!-- 论文1 -->
        <div class="paper-card">
            <div class="paper-figure">
                <img src="paper1.png" alt="Mineral-guided molecular enrichment">
            </div>
            <div class="paper-content">
                <div class="paper-title">Mineral-guided molecular enrichment: An interfacial driving force for protocell emergence on early Earth</div>
                <div class="paper-authors">WeiFeng Chen, Rongfeng Zheng, Shiyuan Pei, Guoquan Wu, Jiayu Lei, Zhaosen Luo, Haochun Gou, Hao Li, Chunhui Li, Guozhi Yu</div>
                <div class="paper-abstract">The emergence of protocells from dilute prebiotic environments is constrained by the dilution paradox, whereby low molecular concentrations hinder the assembly of metabolic and compartmentalized systems. Here we show that mineral-guided surface enrichment (MSE) provides a geochemically plausible mechanism to address this constraint.</div>
                <a href="https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.11.12.687952" target="_blank" class="paper-link">View on bioRxiv</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 论文2 -->
        <div class="paper-card">
            <div class="paper-figure">
                <img src="paper2.png" alt="IDR aggregates in E. coli">
            </div>
            <div class="paper-content">
                <div class="paper-title">Two eukaryotic phase-separating protein IDRs form aggregates and induce filamentation in Escherichia coli</div>
                <div class="paper-authors">WeiFeng Chen, XiuRoo Tan, Guozhi Yu</div>
                <div class="paper-abstract">Intrinsically disordered regions (IDRs) of RNA-binding proteins such as FUS and hnRNPA1 drive biomolecular phase separation in eukaryotes, yet their behavior in prokaryotes remains poorly understood.</div>
                <a href="javascript:alert('PDF will be uploaded soon')" class="paper-link">PDF (Coming soon)</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>